    "type": "game",
    "name": "UNIVERSE SLIME",
    "steam_appid": 3872640,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThe player controls a Universe Slime, a remnant of a star.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbUniverse Slime can destroy various objects such as buildings by jumping and stomping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbBy destroying buildings, Universe Slime swallows rubble and grows larger. Universe Slime can also swallow objects smaller than itself without destroying them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThe goal of this game is to grow Universe Slime and reach the sun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story begins on Earth, on the verge of being swallowed by the Sun due to its gravitational collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Universe Slime, a remnant of a star, grows larger and larger with each substance it swallows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first it can only swallow small objects, but through repeated destruction it will swallow buildings and cities, eventually growing large enough to swallow the Sun and save the solar system.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThe player controls a Universe Slime, a remnant of a star.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbUniverse Slime can destroy various objects such as buildings by jumping and stomping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbBy destroying buildings, Universe Slime swallows rubble and grows larger. Universe Slime can also swallow objects smaller than itself without destroying them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThe goal of this game is to grow Universe Slime and reach the sun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story begins on Earth, on the verge of being swallowed by the Sun due to its gravitational collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Universe Slime, a remnant of a star, grows larger and larger with each substance it swallows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first it can only swallow small objects, but through repeated destruction it will swallow buildings and cities, eventually growing large enough to swallow the Sun and save the solar system.</p>",
    "short_description": "Control the Universe Slime, destroy towns and cities, swallow everything, and become a new star to replace the sun and save the solar system.",
